<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EZR" style="id">- Biblica® Open New Luo Translation 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezra</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezr</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezra</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZR 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Sairas okonyo joma ni e twech odwogo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 1:1"/>E higa mokwongo mar loch Sairas ruodh Pasia, mondo ochop singo mar wach Jehova Nyasaye mane Jeremia okoro, Jehova Nyasaye nowuoyo gi chuny Sairas ruodh Pasia mondo ogol lendo e pinye duto koketo e ndiko kama:<verse eid="EZR 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 1:2"/>Ma e gima Sairas ruodh Pasia wacho:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 1:2">“ ‘Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach polo, osemiya pinjeruodhi duto manie piny kendo oseyiera mondo agerne hekalu e Jerusalem manie piny Juda. <verse eid="EZR 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 1:3"/>Ngʼato angʼata kuom joge manie dieru, mad Nyasache bed kode, mondo odhi Jerusalem man Juda mi oger hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, Nyasaye man Jerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 1:4"/>To ji moa kamoro amora ma joma otony nyalo bet ni koro odakie mondo ochiwne fedha gi dhahabu, kod gik miuso gi kweth mag dhok, to gi chiwo mar hera ne hekalu mar Nyasaye e Jerusalem.’ ”<verse eid="EZR 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 1:5"/>Eka jotend anywola mar Juda kod Benjamin, gi jodolo kod jo-Lawi, ngʼato angʼata ma Nyasaye nomulo chunye, noikore dhi kendo gero od Jehova Nyasaye man Jerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 1:6"/>Jobathgi duto noyworogi gi gige fedha kod dhahabu, kod gik miuso gi kweth mag dhok, kod mich ma nengone tek, kaachiel gi chiwo mar hera.<verse eid="EZR 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 1:7"/>Kata kamano, Ruoth Sairas nochiwo gigo mane mag hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, mane Nebukadneza oyudo osegolo Jerusalem mi otero e hekalu mar nyasache. <verse eid="EZR 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 1:8"/>Sairas ruodh Pasia nowacho ni okelgi gi jakeno, Mithredath, mane okwanogi ne Sheshbaza jatend Juda.<verse eid="EZR 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 1:9"/>Ma e kwan gik mane ochiw:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:9"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">Dise mag dhahabu piero adek,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">dise mag fedha alufu achiel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:9">kareche mag fedha piero ariyo gochiko,<verse eid="EZR 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 1:10"/>bakunde mag dhahabu piero adek,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">bakunde machalre mag fedha mia angʼwen gapar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 1:10">gik mamoko mitiyogo alufu achiel.<verse eid="EZR 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 1:11"/>Gigo duto mane itiyogo mane olosi gi dhahabu kod fedha noromo alufu abich kod mia angʼwen.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 1:11"/>
  <para style="p" vid="EZR 1:11">Sheshbaza nobiro gi gigi duto e kinde mane joma ne otwe noa Babulon kadhi Jerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 1:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZR 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Kwan kod nying joma ne otwe mane odwogo</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 2:1"/>Koro magi e joma noa e gwenge manoduogo koa e twech Babulon, kuma Nebukadneza ruodh Babulon noterogie. Negidwogo Jerusalem kod Juda, ka moro ka moro dok e dalane owuon, <verse eid="EZR 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 2:2"/>ka gin kanyakla gi Zerubabel, Jeshua, Nehemia, Seraya, Relaya, Modekai, Bilshan, Mispar, Bigvai, Rehum kod Baana.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 2:2"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="EZR 2:2">Kar kwan mar nying jo-Israel machwo e magi.<verse eid="EZR 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 2:3"/>Nyikwa Parosh, ji alufu ariyo mia achiel gi piero abiriyo gariyo (2,172),<verse eid="EZR 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 2:4"/>nyikwa Shefatia, ji mia adek gi piero abiriyo gariyo (372),<verse eid="EZR 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 2:5"/>nyikwa Ara, ji mia abiriyo gi piero abiriyo gabich (775),<verse eid="EZR 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 2:6"/>nyikwa Pahath-Moab (mowuok e dhood Jeshua gi Joab), ji alufu ariyo mia aboro gi apar gariyo (2,812),<verse eid="EZR 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 2:7"/>nyikwa Elam, ji alufu achiel mia ariyo gi piero abich gangʼwen (1,254),<verse eid="EZR 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 2:8"/>nyikwa Zatu, ji mia ochiko gi piero angʼwen gabich (945),<verse eid="EZR 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 2:9"/>nyikwa Zakai, ji mia abiriyo gi piero auchiel (760),<verse eid="EZR 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 2:10"/>nyikwa Bani, ji mia auchiel gi piero angʼwen gariyo (642),<verse eid="EZR 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 2:11"/>nyikwa Bebai, ji mia auchiel gi piero ariyo gadek (623),<verse eid="EZR 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 2:12"/>nyikwa Azgad, ji alufu achiel mia ariyo gi piero ariyo gariyo (1,222),<verse eid="EZR 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 2:13"/>nyikwa Adonikam, ji mia auchiel gi piero auchiel gauchiel (666),<verse eid="EZR 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 2:14"/>nyikwa Bigvai, ji alufu ariyo gi piero abich gauchiel (2,056),<verse eid="EZR 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 2:15"/>nyikwa Adin, ji mia angʼwen gi piero abich gangʼwen (454),<verse eid="EZR 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 2:16"/>nyikwa Ater (kowuok e dhood Hezekia), ji piero ochiko gaboro (98),<verse eid="EZR 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 2:17"/>nyikwa Bezai, ji mia adek gi piero adek gadek (323)<verse eid="EZR 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 2:18"/>nyikwa Jora, ji mia achiel gi apar gariyo (112),<verse eid="EZR 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 2:19"/>nyikwa Hashum, ji mia ariyo gi piero ariyo gadek (223),<verse eid="EZR 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 2:20"/>nyikwa Gibar, ji piero ochiko gabich (95),<verse eid="EZR 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 2:21"/>jo-Bethlehem, ji mia achiel gi piero ariyo gadek (123),<verse eid="EZR 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 2:22"/>nyikwa Netofa, ji piero abich gauchiel (56),<verse eid="EZR 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 2:23"/>nyikwa Anathoth, ji mia achiel gi piero ariyo gaboro (128),<verse eid="EZR 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 2:24"/>nyikwa Azmaveth, ji piero angʼwen gariyo (42),<verse eid="EZR 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 2:25"/>nyikwa Kiriath Jearim, Kefira kod Beeroth, ji mia abiriyo gi piero angʼwen gadek (743),<verse eid="EZR 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 2:26"/>nyikwa Rama kod Geba, ji mia auchiel gi piero ariyo gachiel (621),<verse eid="EZR 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 2:27"/>nyikwa Mikmash, ji mia achiel gi piero ariyo gariyo (122),<verse eid="EZR 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 2:28"/>nyikwa Bethel kod Ai, ji mia ariyo gi piero ariyo gadek (223),<verse eid="EZR 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 2:29"/>nyikwa Nebo, ji piero abich gariyo (52),<verse eid="EZR 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 2:30"/>nyikwa Magbish, ji mia achiel gi piero abich gauchiel (156),<verse eid="EZR 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 2:31"/>nyikwa Elam moko, ji alufu achiel mia ariyo gi piero abich gangʼwen (1,254),<verse eid="EZR 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 2:32"/>nyikwa Harim, ji mia adek gi piero ariyo (320)<verse eid="EZR 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 2:33"/>nyikwa Lod, Hadid kod Ono, ji mia abiriyo gi piero ariyo gabich (725),<verse eid="EZR 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 2:34"/>nyikwa Jeriko, ji mia adek gi piero angʼwen gabich (345),<verse eid="EZR 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 2:35"/>nyikwa Sena, ji alufu adek mia auchiel gi piero adek (3,630).<verse eid="EZR 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 2:36"/>Jodolo ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:36">nyikwa Jedaya (mowuok e dhood Jeshua), ji mia ochiko gi piero abiriyo gadek (973),<verse eid="EZR 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 2:37"/>nyikwa Imer, ji alufu achiel gi piero abich gariyo (1,052),<verse eid="EZR 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 2:38"/>nyikwa Pashur, ji alufu achiel mia ariyo gi piero angʼwen gabiriyo (1,247),<verse eid="EZR 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 2:39"/>nyikwa Harim, ji alufu achiel gi apar gabiriyo (1,017).<verse eid="EZR 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 2:40"/>Jo-Lawi ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:40">nyikwa Jeshua kod Kadmiel (mowuok e dhood Hodavia), ji piero abiriyo gangʼwen (74).<verse eid="EZR 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 2:41"/>Jower ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:41">Nyikwa Asaf, ji mia achiel gi piero ariyo gaboro (128).<verse eid="EZR 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 2:42"/>Jorit dhoranga hekalu ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:42">Nyikwa Shalum, Ater, Talmon, Akub, Hatita kod Shobai, ji mia achiel gi piero adek gochiko (139).<verse eid="EZR 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 2:43"/>Jotij hekalu ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:43">nyikwa</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:43">Ziha, Hasufa, Tabaoth,<verse eid="EZR 2:43"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 2:44"/>Keros, Siaha, Padon,<verse eid="EZR 2:44"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZR 2:45"/>Lebana, Hagaba, Akub,<verse eid="EZR 2:45"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZR 2:46"/>Hagab, Shalmai, Hanan,<verse eid="EZR 2:46"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZR 2:47"/>Gidel, Gahar, Reaya,<verse eid="EZR 2:47"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZR 2:48"/>Rezin, Nekoda, Gazam,<verse eid="EZR 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZR 2:49"/>Uza, Pasea, Besai,<verse eid="EZR 2:49"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZR 2:50"/>Asna, Meunim, Nefusim,<verse eid="EZR 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZR 2:51"/>Bakbuk, Hakufa, Harhur,<verse eid="EZR 2:51"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZR 2:52"/>Bazluth, Mehida, Harsha,<verse eid="EZR 2:52"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZR 2:53"/>Barkos, Sisera, Tema,<verse eid="EZR 2:53"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZR 2:54"/>Nezia kod Hatifa.<verse eid="EZR 2:54"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZR 2:55"/>Nyikwa jotij Solomon ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:55">nyikwa</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:55">Sotai, Hasofereth, Peruda,<verse eid="EZR 2:55"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZR 2:56"/>Jaala, Darkon, Gidel,<verse eid="EZR 2:56"/></para>
  <para style="li2">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZR 2:57"/>Shefatia, Hatil,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 2:57">Pokereth-Hazebaim kod Ami.<verse eid="EZR 2:57"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZR 2:58"/>Jotij hekalu kod nyikwa jotij Solomon, ji mia adek gi piero ochiko gariyo (392).<verse eid="EZR 2:58"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZR 2:59"/>Magi e joma nobiro koa e mier mag Tel Mela, Tel Harsha, Kerub, Adon, kod Imer, to ne ok ginyal nyiso malongʼo ni anywolagi ne gin nyikwa Israel.<verse eid="EZR 2:59"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZR 2:60"/>Nyikwa Delaya, Tobia kod Nekoda noromo ji mia auchiel gi piero abich gariyo (652).<verse eid="EZR 2:60"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZR 2:61"/>Mago mane oa kuom jodolo ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 2:61">nyikwa Hobaya, Hakoz kod Barzilai (ngʼatno mane okendo nyar Barzilai ma ja-Gilead to kendo ne iluonge gi nyingno).<verse eid="EZR 2:61"/></para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZR 2:62"/>Jogi nomanyo nonro mar anywolagi, to ne ok ginyal yudogi, omiyo nowegi oko mar joka jodolo kaka joma ochido. <verse eid="EZR 2:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZR 2:63"/>Jatelo maduongʼ nomiyogi chik mondo kik gicham chiemo moro amora mopwodhi manyaka jadolo bedie ma puonjogi gi Urim kod Thumim.<verse eid="EZR 2:63"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="EZR 2:64"/>Jogi duto noromo ji alufu piero angʼwen gariyo mia adek gi piero auchiel (42,360), <verse eid="EZR 2:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="EZR 2:65"/>kiweyo jotijegi machwo kod mamon mane gin ji alufu abiriyo mia adek gi piero adek gabiriyo (7,337); kendo ne gin gi jower machwo kod mamon maromo ji mia ariyo (200). <verse eid="EZR 2:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="EZR 2:66"/>Ne gin gi farese mia abiriyo gi piero adek gauchiel (736), kanyna mia ariyo gi piero angʼwen gabich (245), <verse eid="EZR 2:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="EZR 2:67"/>ngamia mia angʼwen gi piero adek gabich (435) kod punde alufu auchiel mia abiriyo gi piero ariyo (6,720).<verse eid="EZR 2:67"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="EZR 2:68"/>Kane gichopo e od Jehova Nyasaye man Jerusalem, jotend mier mamoko nochiwo chiwo mar hera ne gedo mar od Nyasaye e kare mane entiere chon. <verse eid="EZR 2:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="EZR 2:69"/>Kaluwore gi nyalo mag-gi negichiwone kar keno kuom tijni drachmas alufu piero auchiel gachiel (61,000) mar dhahabu (marom gi kilo mia abich mar dhahabu), minas alufu abich (5,000) mar fedha (marom gi kilo alufu adek mar fedha) kod lep dolo mia achiel.<verse eid="EZR 2:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="EZR 2:70"/>Jodolo, jo-Lawi, jower, jorit dhorangeye kod jotij hekalu nodak Jerusalem, kaachiel gi joma moko, to jo-Israel mamoko nodak e miechgi.<verse eid="EZR 2:70"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZR 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Gero kendo manyien mar misango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 3:1"/>Kane dwe mar abiriyo ochopo kendo jo-Israel nosechako dak e miechgi, negichokore kaka joka ngʼato achiel e Jerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 3:2"/>Eka Jeshua wuod Jozadak kod jodolo wetene kod Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel gi jogo mane tiyo kode nochako gero kendo mar misango mar Nyasach Israel mondo time chiwo mar misango miwangʼo pep, kaluwore gi gima ondiki e Chike Musa, ngʼat Nyasaye. <verse eid="EZR 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 3:3"/>Kata obedo nine giluoro joma ne olworogi kamano, negigero kendo mar misango e mise mare mi gichiwo misango miwangʼo pep ne Jehova Nyasaye, misango mokinyi kaachiel gi modhiambo. <verse eid="EZR 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 3:4"/>Bangʼe kaluwore gi gima ondiki, negitimo nyasi mar Sawo mar kiche ka gin gi kwan mar misengini miwangʼo pep mowinjore mar odiechiengʼ ka odiechiengʼ. <verse eid="EZR 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 3:5"/>Bangʼ mano, negichiwo misango miwangʼo pep mapile pile, misango mar Dwe Manyien kod sewni moyier mag Jehova Nyasaye, kaachiel gi mago mokel kaka chiwo mar hera ne Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="EZR 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 3:6"/>E odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mar abiriyo, negichako kelo chiwo mar misengini miwangʼo pep ne Jehova Nyasaye, kata obedo ni mise mar hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye ne pok ochaki.<verse eid="EZR 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gedo manyien mar hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 3:7"/>Eka negichiwo pesa ne jogedo kod funde bao, kendo gichiwo chiemo gi math gi mo ne jo-Sidon gi jo-Turo, mondo omi gikel sirni mag sida koluwo nam koa Lebanon nyaka Jopa, kaluwore gi thuolo mane ochiw gi Sairas ruodh Pasia.<verse eid="EZR 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 3:8"/>E dwe mar ariyo mar higa mar ariyo bangʼ kane gichopo e od Nyasaye e Jerusalem, Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel, Jeshua wuod Jozadak kod owetege mamoko (jodolo gi jo-Lawi kod jogo duto mane odwogo Jerusalem koa e twech) nochako tich, ka giyiero jo-Lawi moromo higni piero ariyo kod jomadongo mondo ginon gedo mar od Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="EZR 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 3:9"/>Jeshua gi yawuote kod owetene gi Kadmiel kod yawuote (ma nyikwa Hodavia) kod yawuot Henadad gi yawuote kod owetene, ma gin jo-Lawi duto, noriwore kanyakla ka gingʼiyo jogo matiyo e od Nyasaye.<verse eid="EZR 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 3:10"/>Ka jogedo noketo mise mar hekalu mar Jehova Nyasaye, jodolo korwako lepgi mag dolo ka gin gi turumbete, kod jo-Lawi (ma yawuot Asaf) ka gin-gi ongengʼo, nokawo keregi mondo gipak Jehova Nyasaye, kaka nochan gi Daudi ruodh Israel. <verse eid="EZR 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 3:11"/>Ka gipako Jehova Nyasaye kendo gigoyone erokamano ne giwerne kama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZR 3:11">“Jehova Nyasaye ber;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZR 3:11">kendo hera mare ne jo-Israel osiko nyaka chiengʼ.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZR 3:11">To ji duto nogoyo koko matek mar Pak ne Jehova Nyasaye, nikech mise mar od Jehova Nyasaye noketi. <verse eid="EZR 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 3:12"/>To jodolo machon kod jo-Lawi gi jotend anywola, mane oseneno hekalu mokwongo, noywak matek ka gineno kiketo mise mar hekalu, to ji mamoko nokok gi ilo. <verse eid="EZR 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 3:13"/>Onge ngʼama ne nyalo pogo dwol mar goyo koko mar ilo gi dwol mar ywak, nikech ji nogoyo koko matek, kendo dwolno nowinj gi kuma bor.<verse eid="EZR 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZR 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Okwed gedo manyien mar hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 4:1"/>Ka wasik Juda gi Benjamin nowinjo ni joma notwe ne gero hekalu ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, <verse eid="EZR 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 4:2"/>negibiro ir Zerubabel to gi jotend anywola mi giwacho niya, “We wakonyu gedo nikech Nyasachuno ema wan bende wasebedo ka wachiwone misango nyaka aa kinde Esarhadon ruodh Asuria, mane okelowa kae.”<verse eid="EZR 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 4:3"/>To Zerubabel, Jeshua kod jotend anywola duto mag Israel nodwokogi niya, “Ok un e achiel kodwa e gero hekalu ne Nyasachwa. Wan kendwa wabiro gedo ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, mana kaka Ruoth Sairas, ma ruodh Pasia, nochikowa.”<verse eid="EZR 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 4:4"/>Eka joma ni machiegni kodgi nowuok mondo onyos chuny jo-Juda kendo gibed maluor mar dhi nyime gi gedo. <verse eid="EZR 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 4:5"/>Negikawo jongʼad rieko michulo mondo okwedgi kendo orund chenro mag-gi e ndalono duto mar loch Sairas ruodh Pasia kendo nyaka ndalo loch mar Darius ruodh Pasia.<verse eid="EZR 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwedo gedo mar hekalu e bwo loch Sakses kod Artaksases</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 4:6"/>E chakruok mar loch Sakses, ne gidonjone jo-Juda kod jo-Jerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 4:7"/>To e ndalo mag Artaksases ruodh Pasia, Bishlam, Mithredath, Tabel kod joge mamoko moriwore godo ne ondiko baruwa ne Artaksases. Baruwani nondiki e kit ndiko mar jo-Aram kendo gi dho jo-Aram.<verse eid="EZR 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 4:8"/>Rehum ma jatend lweny kod Shimshai ma jagoro nondiko baruwa marach kuom Jerusalem ne Artaksases ma ruoth kama:<verse eid="EZR 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 4:9"/>Rehum ma jatend lweny kod Shimshai ma jagoro, kanyakla gi jogo mamoko mane gitiyogo, ma gin jongʼad bura kod jotelo motelone joma oa Tripolis, Pasia, Erek, Babulon kod jo-Elam moa Susa, <verse eid="EZR 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 4:10"/>gi joma moko mane Ashurbanipal, ngʼatno maduongʼ kendo moluor noriembo, mi omiyogi kar dak e dala maduongʼ mar Samaria kod kamachielo machiegni gi loka Aora Yufrate.<verse eid="EZR 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 4:11"/>Ma e baruwa machalo gi baruwa mane giorone.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Ne Ruoth Artaksases.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:11">Koa kuom jotichgi modak loka Yufrate.<verse eid="EZR 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 4:12"/>Ruoth nyaka ngʼeni, jo-Yahudi mane obiro irwa koa iri osedhi Jerusalem kendo gisechako gero dala maduongʼ mane ongʼanyo kendo ma timbene mono. Gisechako gero ohinga mane osemukore kendo to bende giloso mise mage.<verse eid="EZR 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 4:13"/>Kuom mano, ruoth onego ngʼe ni ka dala maduongʼni oger kendo ohinga mage ochung kendo, to onge osuru mibiro chul, kata chiwo kod chudo moro amora kendo pesa ma joka ruoth yudo ok nogol. <verse eid="EZR 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 4:14"/>Nimar wan e bwo chik mar kar dak ruoth kendo ok en gima ber mondo wane ka ruoth ichayo, waoro wachni mondo onyis ruoth, <verse eid="EZR 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 4:15"/>mondo omany kuonde mokanie gik machon mag ruodhi miluwo bangʼ-gi. E ndiko machon mokan ibiro yudo ni dala maduongʼni en dala maduongʼ mangʼanyo, ma thago ruodhi kod gwenge, ma en kar ngʼanyo chakre chon. Mano emomiyo dala maduongʼni nokethi. <verse eid="EZR 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 4:16"/>Wanyiso ruoth ni ka dala maduongʼni oger kendo ohingage ochungi, to onge gima ibiro dongʼ godo e loka mar Aora Yufrate.<verse eid="EZR 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 4:17"/>Ruoth nooro dwoko kama:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Ne Rehum jatend lweny, Shimshai jagoro kod jogi mamoko ma utiyogo kanyakla modak Samaria gi kuonde mopogore e loka mar Aora Yufrate.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 4:17">Amosou.<verse eid="EZR 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 4:18"/>Baruwa mane ioronwa osesomnwa kendo oloki e nyima. <verse eid="EZR 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 4:19"/>Ne achiwo chik kendo nonro notim, kendo noyud ni dala maduongʼni nigi sigana mabor mar ngʼanyone ruodhi kendo en kar wich teko kod wacho weche mag wich teko. <verse eid="EZR 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 4:20"/>Jerusalem osebedo gi ruodhi maroteke ka girito piny Yufrate duto, kendo osuru, chiwo ma ruoth ketone joma otelone, kod chudo moro amora mag gik miloko nochulgi. <verse eid="EZR 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 4:21"/>Koro chiw chik ne jogi mondo giwe tich, mondo omi dala maduongʼni kik ger kendo nyaka an ema achiw chik. <verse eid="EZR 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 4:22"/>Bed motangʼ mondo kik ijwangʼ wachni. Angʼo momiyo wach manyalo kelo hinyruok nyaa, mi lochwa kethre?<verse eid="EZR 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 4:23"/>Mapiyo nono bangʼ ka baruwa machal gi mane oor ne Ruoth Artaksases nosesom ne Rehum kod Shimshai ma jagoro gi joma gitiyogo kanyakla, negidhi mana gisano Jerusalem ir jo-Yahudi kendo ne gichunogi mondo giwe tich.<verse eid="EZR 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 4:24"/>Omiyo tich mane ni e od Nyasaye man Jerusalem nochungʼ nyaka e higa mar ariyo mar loch Darius ruodh Pasia.<verse eid="EZR 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZR 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Barup Tatenai ne Darius</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 5:1"/>Koro Hagai janabi kod Zekaria janabi, nyakwar Ido, nokorone jo-Yahudi e Juda gi Jerusalem e nying Nyasach Israel, mane nitiere kuomgi. <verse eid="EZR 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 5:2"/>Eka Zerubabel wuod Shealtiel kod Jeshua wuod Jozadak nowuok mondo oti tij gedo mar od Nyasaye e Jerusalem. Kendo jonabi mag Nyasaye ne ni kodgi, kakonyogi.<verse eid="EZR 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 5:3"/>E kindeno Tatenai, ruodh Yufrate, kod Shetha-Bozenai gi joma gitiyogo kanyakla nodhi irgi kendo openjo niya, “En ngʼa mane omiyou thuolo mar gero hekaluni kendo loso iye?” <verse eid="EZR 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 5:4"/>Gin bende negipenjo niya, “Joma gero odni nying-gi ngʼa?” <verse eid="EZR 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 5:5"/>To Nyasaye ne ni kod jodong jo-Yahudi, omiyo ne ok ochung-gi mondo giwe tich ka pod irito dwoko ma ruoth Darius ondiko gi lwete.<verse eid="EZR 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 5:6"/>Ma e baruwa machal gi mane Tatenai, ruodh Yufrate, kod Shetha-Bozenai gi joma negitiyogo kanyakla, kod jotend Yufrate, noorone Ruoth Darius. <verse eid="EZR 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 5:7"/>Wach mane giorone ne chalo kama:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Ne Ruoth Darius:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:7"/>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 5:7">Wamosi ahinya.<verse eid="EZR 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 5:8"/>Ruoth onego ngʼe nine wadhi e gwengʼ mar Juda, e hekalu mar Nyasaye maduongʼ. Ji gedo gi kite madongo kendo giketo bepe e kore. Tich tiyore e yo modimbore kendo odhi nyime mapiyo e bwo telo margi.<verse eid="EZR 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 5:9"/>Ne wamiyo jodongo penjo ka wapenjogi niya, “En ngʼa momiyou thuolo mar gero hekaluni kendo loso iye?” <verse eid="EZR 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 5:10"/>Bende ne wapenjogi nying-gi, mondo omi wandik nying jotendgi ne in.<verse eid="EZR 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 5:11"/>Ma e dwoko mane gimiyowa:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 5:11"/>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 5:11">Wan jotich mar Nyasach polo kod piny, kendo wagero hekalu manyien mane oger higni mangʼeny mokalo, mano mane ruoth maduongʼ mar Israel ogero kendo otieko. <verse eid="EZR 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 5:12"/>To nikech wuonewa nowangʼo ii Nyasach Polo, nochiwogi ne Nebukadneza ja-Kaldea, ruodh Babulon, ma nomuko hekaluni kendo oriembo ji nyaka Babulon.<verse eid="EZR 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 5:13"/>Kata kamano, e higa mokwongo mar Sairas ruodh Babulon, Ruoth Sairas nochiwo chik mondo odni mar Nyasaye oger manyien. <verse eid="EZR 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 5:14"/>Bende nogolo koa e hekalu mar Babulon gige dhahabu gi fedha mar od Nyasaye, gigo mane Nebukadneza okawo koa e hekalu man Jerusalem kendo okelo e hekalu man Babulon. Bangʼe Ruoth Sairas nomiyogi ngʼat ma nyinge Sheshbaza, mane osewalo jatelo, <verse eid="EZR 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 5:15"/>kendo onyise niya, “Kaw gigi kendo idhi mi ikan-gi e hekalu man Jerusalem. Kendo iger manyien od Nyasaye e kare machon.”<verse eid="EZR 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 5:16"/>Omiyo ngʼatni miluongo ni Sheshbaza nobiro mi oketo mise mar od Nyasaye e Jerusalem. Kochakore e odiechiengno nyaka sani pod igere to pod ok otieke.<verse eid="EZR 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 5:17"/>Omiyo koro ka berne ruoth, to mondo nonro otim e kar keno mag gik machon mar Babulon mondo ne ka Ruoth Sairas nochiwo chik mondo oger manyien od Nyasaye e Jerusalem. Eka ruoth mondo oornwa kaka ongʼado wachni.<verse eid="EZR 5:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZR 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Chik ma Darius ogolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 6:1"/>Eka Ruoth Darius nochiwo chik, kendo neginono e kuonde kano gik machon e kar keno man Babulon. <verse eid="EZR 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 6:2"/>Karatas moban noyudi e kama oger motegno mar gengʼo wasigu mar Ekbatana e gwengʼ Media, kendo ma e gima nondik kuome:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 6:2">Chenro mar gima biro:<verse eid="EZR 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 6:3"/>E higa mokwongo mar loch mar Ruoth Sairas, ruoth nochiwo chik kuom hekalu mar Nyasaye man Jerusalem kama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 6:3"/>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:3">We hekalu ger kendo kaka kar chiwo misango, kendo we mise mare keti. Nyaka obedi fut piero aboro gaboro gi nus e bor mare kendo fut piero aboro gaboro e lach mare, <verse eid="EZR 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 6:4"/>kod migawo adek mag kite mochwe kadhi malo gi migawo achiel mag bepe mochungi. Chudo margi mondo chul gi keno moa ka ruoth. <verse eid="EZR 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 6:5"/>Bende, gigo mag dhahabu gi fedha mag od Nyasaye, mane Nebukadneza okawo koa e hekalu mar Jerusalem mi okelo Babulon, nyaka duog kargi e hekalu man Jerusalem; nyaka duog-gi e kar keno e od Nyasaye.<verse eid="EZR 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 6:6"/>Koro in, Tatenai, jatelo mar Yufrate, kod Shetha-Bozenai kaachiel gi un, jotelo wetegi mar gwengʼno, suduru mabor gi kanyo. <verse eid="EZR 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 6:7"/>Kik uketh tich hekaluni mar Nyasaye. We jatend jo-Yahudi kod jodong jo-Yahudi oger od Nyasaye e kare.<verse eid="EZR 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 6:8"/>Kuom mano, achiwo chik mar gima onego itimne jodong jo-Yahudi e gedo mar odni mar Nyasaye:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:8">Gigo ma jogi otiyogo nyaka chul duto koa e keno mar ka ruoth, moa e pesa mochoki kuom Yufrate, mondo omi tich kik chungʼ. <verse eid="EZR 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 6:9"/>Gimoro amora midwaro kaka nyirwedhi, imbe, nyiimbe mar misango miwangʼo pep ne Nyasach polo, kod ngano, chumbi, divai gi mo, kaka okwa gi jodolo man Jerusalem nyaka migi pile ma ok olewo, <verse eid="EZR 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 6:10"/>mondo omi gichiw misengini ma moro Nyasach polo kendo olam ne ruoth gi yawuote obed gi ngima maber.<verse eid="EZR 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 6:11"/>Ewi mano, achiwo chik ni ka ngʼato oketho chikni, to nogol yiend tado mar ode mi gur piny kendo tweye e yien-no. <verse eid="EZR 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 6:12"/>Mad Nyasaye, mosemiyo Nyinge olandore ka, lok ruoth moro amora kata joma tingʼo bedegi malo mondo olok chikni kata oketh hekaluni man Jerusalem.</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 6:12">An, Darius asegolo chik, kendo chikni nyaka chopi ma ok orem.<verse eid="EZR 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tieko gedo kendo gwedho hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 6:13"/>To kuom chik mane Ruoth Darius ooro, Tatenai, jatend Yufrate, kod Shetha-Bozenai gi joma negitiyogo kanyakla notimo kamano kuom tangʼ mathoth. <verse eid="EZR 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 6:14"/>Omiyo jodong jo-Yahudi nodhi nyime gi gedo kendo odhi maber e bwo yalo mar Hagai janabi gi Zekaria, nyakwar Ido. Negitieko gero hekalu kaluwore gi chik mar Nyasach Israel kod chike Sairas, Darius gi Artaksases, ruodhi Pasia. <verse eid="EZR 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 6:15"/>Hekalu notieki gero e odiechiengʼ mar adek mar dwe mar Adar, e higa mar auchiel mar loch Ruoth Darius.<verse eid="EZR 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 6:16"/>Eka jo-Israel, ma gin jodolo, jo-Lawi kod joma moko mane oa e twech notimo nyasi mar gwedho od Nyasaye gi ilo. <verse eid="EZR 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 6:17"/>Kane gigwedho od Nyasaye negichiwo rwedhi mia achiel, imbe mia ariyo, nyithi rombe machwo mia angʼwen to kaka misango mar golo richo ne Israel, negichiwo diek apar gariyo machwo, moro ka moro ni dhout Israel. <verse eid="EZR 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 6:18"/>Kendo negiketo jodolo kuondegi kod jo-Lawi e migepe mag-gi ne tich Nyasaye e Jerusalem, kaluwore gi gima ondikie Kitap Musa.<verse eid="EZR 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 6:19"/>E odiechiengʼ mar apar gangʼwen mar dwe mokwongo, joma notwe notimo nyasi mar Pasaka. <verse eid="EZR 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 6:20"/>Jodolo gi jo-Lawi nosepwodhore giwegi kendo giduto negiikore mapoth ne nyasi. Jo-Lawi noyangʼo nyarombo mar Pasaka ne joma noa e twech duto, ne owetegi ma jodolo kod gin giwegi. <verse eid="EZR 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 6:21"/>Omiyo jo-Israel mane oa e twech nochamo Pasakano, kanyakla gi jogo duto mano ngʼanyone timbe mochido mag ogendini mamoko modak machiegni kodgi mondo omi gidwar Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel. <verse eid="EZR 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 6:22"/>Kuom ndalo abiriyo, negitimo Nyasi mar Makati ma ok oketie thowi gi ilo, nikech Jehova Nyasaye nosepongʼogi gi ilo kuom loko pach ruodh Asuria, mondo omi nokonygi e tich manie od Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel.<verse eid="EZR 6:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZR 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ezra obiro Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 7:1"/>Bangʼ gigi duto, e kinde mar loch Artaksases ruodh Pasia, Ezra wuod Seraya, ma wuod Azaria, ma wuod Hilkia, <verse eid="EZR 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 7:2"/>ma wuod Shalum, ma wuod Zadok, ma wuod Ahitub, <verse eid="EZR 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 7:3"/>ma wuod Amaria, ma wuod Azaria, ma wuod Merayoth, <verse eid="EZR 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 7:4"/>ma wuod Zerahia, ma wuod Uzi, ma wuod Buki, <verse eid="EZR 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 7:5"/>ma wuod Abishua, ma wuod Finehas, ma wuod Eliazar, ma wuod Harun jadolo maduongʼ; <verse eid="EZR 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 7:6"/>Ezra-ni noduogo koa Babulon. Ne en japuonj man-gi lony mathoth kuom Chik Musa, ma Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, nochiwo. Ruoth nomiye gimoro amora mano kwayo, nimar lwet Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasache ne ni kuome. <verse eid="EZR 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 7:7"/>Jo-Israel mamoko, kaachiel gi jodolo, jo-Lawi, jower, jorit rangach kod jotij hekalu, bende nobiro Jerusalem e higa mar abiriyo mar Ruoth Artaksases.<verse eid="EZR 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 7:8"/>Ezra nochopo Jerusalem e dwe mar abich mar higa mar abiriyo mar ruoth. <verse eid="EZR 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 7:9"/>Nochako wuodhe koa Babulon e odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mokwongo, kendo nochopo Jerusalem e odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mar abich, nimar lwedo mangʼwon mar Nyasache ne ni kuome. <verse eid="EZR 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 7:10"/>Nimar Ezra nosechiwore owuon ne somo matut kendo rito Chik mar Jehova Nyasaye, kod puonjo chikene gi buchene e Israel.<verse eid="EZR 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barup ruoth Artaksases ne Ezra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 7:11"/>Ma e baruwa machalre gi mane mane Ruoth Artaksases omiyo Ezra jadolo kendo japuonj, ngʼatno mosomo weche maluwore gi chike kod buche Jehova Nyasaye ne Israel:<verse eid="EZR 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 7:12"/>Artaksases, ruoth mar ruodhi,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 7:12"/>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Ne Ezra jadolo kendo japuonj mar Chik Nyasach Polo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZR 7:12"/>
  <para style="pmo" vid="EZR 7:12">Amosi.<verse eid="EZR 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 7:13"/>Koro achiwo chik ni ja-Israel moro amora manie pinya, kaachiel gi jodolo kod jo-Lawi, madwaro dhi Jerusalem kodi, nyalo dhi. <verse eid="EZR 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 7:14"/>Oori gi ruoth kod jongʼadne rieko abiriyo mondo inon wach kaka Juda gi Jerusalem dhi kaluwore gi chik Nyasachi manie lweti. <verse eid="EZR 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 7:15"/>To bende, nyaka idhi gi fedha kod dhahabu ma ruoth gi jongʼadne rieko osechiwo kuom hero mag-gi giwegi ne Nyasach Israel, ma kar dak mare en Jerusalem, <verse eid="EZR 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 7:16"/>kaachiel gi fedha gi dhahabu duto ma unyalo yudo koa e gwengʼ mar Babulon, kanyakla gi chiwo ma ji kod jodolo golo ma en chiwo mar hera ne hekalu mar Nyasachgi e Jerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 7:17"/>Gi pesani nyaka ine ni ingʼiewo rwedhi, imbe kod nyithi rombe machwo, kanyakla gi chiwo mag-gi mag cham kod misango miolo piny, kendo gitimgo misango ewi kendo mar hekalu mar Nyasachi e Jerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 7:18"/>In kod oweteni ma jo-Yahudi unyalo timo gima uneno ka ber gi fedha gi dhahabu modongʼ, kaluwore gi dwaro mar Nyasachi. <verse eid="EZR 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 7:19"/>Chiwne Nyasach Jerusalem gigo duto moket e lweti mar dendo Nyasaye e hekalu mar Nyasachi. <verse eid="EZR 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 7:20"/>Kendo gimoro amora midwaro mar hekalu mar Nyasachi ma inyalo bedo gi thuolo mar chiwo, inyalo chiwe koa e keno ma ka ruoth.<verse eid="EZR 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 7:21"/>Koro an, Ruoth Artaksases, achiwo chik ni kuonde keno duto mag Yufrate ochiw gi chia gimoro amora ma Ezra jadolo, japuonj Chik mar Nyasach polo, nyalo kwayou, kaka <verse eid="EZR 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 7:22"/>fedha madirom kilo alufu adek gi mia angʼwen, gunde mag ngano ma pek romo kilo alufu apar gaboro, divai maromo lita alufu ariyo gi mia ariyo, mo maromo lita alufu ariyo gi mia ariyo, kod chumbi mathoth ma ok nyal pim. <verse eid="EZR 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 7:23"/>Gimoro amora ma Nyasach polo osechano, we otime gi chia ne hekalu mar Nyasach polo. En angʼo momiyo mirima dibed kuom pinyruoth gi yawuote? <verse eid="EZR 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 7:24"/>Bende nyaka ingʼe ni ionge gi teko mar chuno ji golo osuru, kata chiwo kata chudo ewi jadolo, jo-Lawi, jower, jorit rangach, jatij hekalu moro amora kata jotich mamoko e odni mar Nyasaye.<verse eid="EZR 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 7:25"/>To in, Ezra, kaluwore gi rieko matut mar Nyasachi, ma in godo, yier jongʼad bura matindo kod jongʼad bura madongo mondo ongʼad bura gadiera ne jo-Yufrate duto, ma gin joma ongʼeyo chike Nyasachi. Kendo nyaka ipuonj ngʼato angʼata mokia chikego. <verse eid="EZR 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 7:26"/>Ngʼato angʼata ma ok luor chik Nyasachi kod chik ruoth nyaka kume e yor tho, dare, pe gige, kata tere e od twech.<verse eid="EZR 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 7:27"/>Pak obed ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach kwerewa, moseketo e chuny ruoth mondo luor obed ne od Jehova Nyasaye man Jerusalem e yo machalo kama <verse eid="EZR 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 7:28"/>kendo moserieyo lwete maber mar ngʼwono ne an e nyim ruoth kod jongʼadne rieko kod jotend ruoth maroteke mondo omiya luor. Nikech lwet Jehova Nyasaye Nyasacha neni kuoma, ne abedo gi chir mi achoko jotelo duto moa Israel mondo odhi koda.<verse eid="EZR 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZR 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Nying kod kwan jotend dhoudi mane odwogo gi Ezra</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 8:1"/>Magi e jotend dhoudi kod jogo mane obiro koda koa Babulon e kinde loch Ruoth Artaksases:<verse eid="EZR 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 8:2"/>nyikwa Finehas,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Gershom;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">nyikwa Ithamar,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Daniel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:2">nyikwa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:2">Hatush <verse eid="EZR 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 8:3"/>nyikwa Shekania;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 8:3">nyikwa Parosh,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:3">Zekaria, kaachiel kode ji mia achiel gi piero abich;<verse eid="EZR 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 8:4"/>nyikwa Pahath-Moab,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:4">Elihoyanai wuod Zerahia, kaachiel kode ji mia ariyo;<verse eid="EZR 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 8:5"/>nyikwa Zatu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:5">Shekania wuod Jahaziel, kaachiel kode ji mia adek;<verse eid="EZR 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 8:6"/>nyikwa Adin,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:6">Ebed wuod Jonathan, kaachiel kode ji piero abich;<verse eid="EZR 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 8:7"/>nyikwa Elam,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:7">Jeshaya wuod Athalia, kaachiel kode ji piero abiriyo;<verse eid="EZR 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 8:8"/>nyikwa Shefatia,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:8">Zebadia wuod Mikael, kaachiel kode ji piero aboro;<verse eid="EZR 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 8:9"/>nyikwa Joab,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:9">Obadia wuod Jehiel, kaachiel kode ji mia ariyo gi apar gaboro;<verse eid="EZR 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 8:10"/>nyikwa Bani,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:10">Shelomith wuod Josifia, kaachiel kode ji mia achiel gi piero auchiel;<verse eid="EZR 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 8:11"/>nyikwa Bebai,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:11">Zekaria wuod Bebai, kaachiel kode ji piero ariyo gaboro;<verse eid="EZR 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 8:12"/>nyikwa Azgad,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:12">Johanan wuod Hakatan, kaachiel kode ji mia achiel gapar;<verse eid="EZR 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 8:13"/>nyikwa Adonikam,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:13">mago mogik, nyingegi ne Elifelet, Jeuel kod Shemaya, kaachiel kodgi ji piero auchiel;<verse eid="EZR 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 8:14"/>nyikwa Bigvai,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 8:14">Uthai kod Zakur, kaachiel kodgi ji piero abiriyo.<verse eid="EZR 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Duogo Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 8:15"/>Ne achokogi e bath aora mamol kochiko Ahava, kendo ne wabuoro kanyo kuom ndalo adek. Kane arango e dier ji kod jodolo, ne ok ayudo jo-Lawi kanyo. <verse eid="EZR 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 8:16"/>Omiyo ne aluongo Eliezer, Ariel, Shemaya, Elnathan, Jarib, Elnathan, Nathan, Zekaria kod Meshulam, mane gin jotelo, kod Joyiarib gi Elnathan, mane gin joma osomo, <verse eid="EZR 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 8:17"/>kendo ne aorogi ir Ido, jatelo Kasifia. Ne anyisogi gima giwachne Ido kod joge, jotij hekalu man Kasifia, mondo omi gikelnwa ji ne od Nyasachwa. <verse eid="EZR 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 8:18"/>Nikech lwet Nyasachwa mar ngʼwono ne ni kuomwa, ne gikelonwa Sherebia, ngʼatno man-gi nyalo, koa e nyikwa Mali wuod Lawi, wuod Israel, kod yawuot Sherebia gi owetene, ji apar gaboro; <verse eid="EZR 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 8:19"/>kod Hashabia, kanyakla gi Jeshaya ma nyikwa Merari, kod owetene gi yawuot owetene, ji piero ariyo. <verse eid="EZR 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 8:20"/>Bende negikelo jotije hekalu mia ariyo gi piero ariyo, ma en riwruok mane Daudi kod jotelo nochako mondo okony jo-Lawi. Giduto nondik nying-gi piny.<verse eid="EZR 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 8:21"/>Bangʼ mano, ne agolo chik mondo watwe chiemo e dho aora Ahava ka wahore wawegi e nyim Nyasachwa kendo wakwaye wuoth maber ni wan gi nyithindwa, gi giwa duto. <verse eid="EZR 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 8:22"/>Wiya nokuot mar kwayo ruodh jolweny kod joriemb farese mondo ogengʼwa kuom wasikwa manie yo, nikech ne wasenyiso ruoth niya, “Lwet Nyasachwa mar ngʼwono nitie kuom ji duto moketo genogi kuome, to mirimbe mager ni kuom jogo mojwangʼe.” <verse eid="EZR 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 8:23"/>Omiyo ne watweyo chiemo kendo wakwayo Nyasachwa kuom ma, kendo nodwoko lamowa.<verse eid="EZR 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 8:24"/>Eka ne awalo jodolo motelo apar gariyo, kanyakla gi Sherebia, Hashabia kod owetegi apar, <verse eid="EZR 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 8:25"/>kendo ne apimonegi pek chiwo mar fedha gi dhahabu kod gik mane ruoth, jongʼadne rieko, jotende kod jo-Israel duto mane ni kanyo nosechiwo ne od Nyasachwa. <verse eid="EZR 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 8:26"/>Ne apimonegi pek mar fedha mane en talanta mia auchiel gi piero abich, gige fedha pekgi ne en talanta mia achiel, pek dhahabu ne en talanta mia achiel, <verse eid="EZR 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 8:27"/>bakunde piero ariyo mar dhahabu ma nengogi romo darik alufu achiel, kod gik moko ariyo mag nyinyo mowir mongʼith, bende maber ka dhahabu.<verse eid="EZR 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 8:28"/>Ne awachonegi niya, “In kaachiel gi gigi owalu tenge ne Jehova Nyasaye. Fedha gi dhahabu gin chiwo mar hera ne Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach kwereu. <verse eid="EZR 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 8:29"/>Ritgiuru ka utangʼ nyaka chop upimgi e agola mar od Jehova Nyasaye man Jerusalem e nyim jodolo motelo gi jo-Lawi kod jotend anywola mag Israel.” <verse eid="EZR 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 8:30"/>Bangʼe jodolo kod jo-Lawi noyudo fedha gi dhahabu kod gik mowal mane osepim pekgi mondo ter e od Nyasachwa e Jerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 8:31"/>E odiechiengʼ mar apar gariyo e dwe mokwongo ne wawuok ka waa e aora mar Ahava mondo wadhi Jerusalem. Lwet Nyasachwa ne ni kuomwa, nogengʼonwa wasigu gi jonjore mane ni e wangʼ yo. <verse eid="EZR 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 8:32"/>Omiyo ne wachopo Jerusalem, kama ne wayweyoe kuom ndalo adek.<verse eid="EZR 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 8:33"/>E odiechiengʼ mar angʼwen, e od Nyasachwa, ne wapimo pek fedha gi dhahabu kod gigo mowal ma waketo e lwet Meremoth wuod Uria, ma jadolo, Eliazar wuod Finehas ne ni kode, kod jo-Lawi bende kaka Jozabad wuod Jeshua gi Noadia wuod Binui. <verse eid="EZR 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 8:34"/>Gik moko nokwan mongʼe kar kwan-gi kod pek mag-gi, kendo pek mag-gi nondik piny e sechego.<verse eid="EZR 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 8:35"/>Eka joma ne otwe mane odwogo koa e twech nochiwo misango mar misengini miwangʼo pep ni Nyasach Israel mane gin, rwedhi apar gariyo ne jo-Israel duto, imbe piero ochiko gauchiel, nyithi rombe machwo piero abiriyo gabiriyo, to gi nywogi apar gariyo kaka misango mar golo richo. Magi duto ne gin misango miwangʼo pep ni Jehova Nyasaye. <verse eid="EZR 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 8:36"/>Bende ne gitero chike mane ruoth ochiwo ni jotend gwenge kod jotend Yufrate, bangʼe negichiwo kony ni ji kod ni od Nyasaye.<verse eid="EZR 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZR 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Lemo mar Ezra kuom nyuomo nyi dhoudi mamoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 9:1"/>Bangʼ ka magi duto nosetim, jotelo nobiro ira kendo owacho niya, “Jo-Israel kaachiel gi jodolo kod jo-Lawi, ok osethegore gi joma ne gikiewogo kuom yoregi mamono, kaka mago mag jo-Kanaan, jo-Hiti, jo-Perizi, jo-Jebus, jo-Amon, jo-Moab, jo-Misri kod jo-Amor. <verse eid="EZR 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 9:2"/>Gisekawo nyi joma ok jo-Yahudi, makoro odak e pinygi, kendo yawuotgi bende gisekendonegi nyi jogo. Kamano, oganda maler mar Nyasaye osedwanyore gi joma ok jo-Yahudi. To jotelo gi jodongo ema osebedo joketho moloyoe jomoko.”<verse eid="EZR 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 9:3"/>Kane awinjo wachno, ne ayiecho kandhona kod lepa, apudho yie wiya kod yie tika mi abedo piny ka an-gi bwok malich. <verse eid="EZR 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 9:4"/>Eka jogo duto mane oluoro wach Nyasach Israel nochokore buta nikech gima rach mane joma odwogo koa e twech Babulon otimo. Kendo ne abedo kanyo ka an-gi bwok malich nyaka ochopo sa misango mar odhiambo.<verse eid="EZR 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 9:5"/>Kane ochopo sa misango mar odhiambo, ne achungo aa kama ne abetie, gi kandhona kod lepa koyiech, mi apodho gi chonga ka atingʼo bedena malo ne Jehova Nyasaye Nyasacha. <verse eid="EZR 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 9:6"/>Kendo ne alemo kama:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="EZR 9:6">“Nyasacha, an-gi wichkuot malich kod kuyo ma ok anyal tingʼo wangʼa malo kangʼiyi, nikech richowa boyo moyombo wiyewa kendo kethowa osechopo e polo. <verse eid="EZR 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 9:7"/>Koa e ndalo mar kwerewa nyaka chil kawuono, wasebedo joketho ahinya. Nikech richo ma wasetimo, ruodhi mag pinje mamoko osenegowa kaachiel gi ruodhiwa kod jodolo mag-wa kendo giseterowa e twech kendo yako gigewa, mi wasebedo gi wichkuot maduongʼ nyaka chil kawuono.<verse eid="EZR 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 9:8"/>“To koro sani, kuom kinde matin, Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasachwa osebedo jangʼwono moweyonwa joma otony kendo omiyowa kama wanyalo dakie e kari maler mar lemo. Isedwogo chunywa, kendo iweyonwa thuolo mondo dendwa oduogi e twech ma wantiereni. <verse eid="EZR 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 9:9"/>Kata bed ni wan wasumbini kamano, to Nyasachwa pod ok ojwangʼowa e twech marwa. Osemiyowa ngʼwonone e nyim wangʼ ruodhi mag Pasia: Osemiyowa ngima manyien mondo oger manyien od Nyasachwa, to bende wager kuonde momukore, kendo osebedonwa kaka ohinga molworo Juda kod Jerusalem.<verse eid="EZR 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 9:10"/>“To sani, yaye Nyasachwa, en angʼo ma wanyalo wacho bangʼ ma? Nimar ok waseluoro chike <verse eid="EZR 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 9:11"/>mane imiyowa kokalo kuom jotichni ma jonabi, kiwacho ni, ‘Piny ma udonje mondo ukaw en piny mopongʼ gi anjawo mag joge. Kuom timbegi mamono gisepongʼo pinyni gi chido margi koa giko koni nyaka giko kocha. <verse eid="EZR 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 9:12"/>Emomiyo, kik uchiw nyiu mondo kend gi yawuotgi, kata kawo nyigi ne yawuotu. Kik ubed gi singruok mar osiep kodgi sa moro amora, mondo omi ubed motegno kendo ucham gik mabeyo mag pinyni kendo uweye ne nyithindu kaka girkeni manyaka chiengʼ.’<verse eid="EZR 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 9:13"/>“Gima osetimorenwa en nikech timbewa mamono kod kethowa ma ok odhi kare, to kata kamano, Nyasachwa, ne ok ikumowa moromore gi richowago, to niweyo jowa otony, mi wabedo thuolo kaka koroni. <verse eid="EZR 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 9:14"/>Bende dwachak waketh chikegi kendo wanywomre gi joma timo timbe mamono kama? Donge iyi diwangʼ kodwa matek madimi itiekwa, maonge ngʼama ditony kata achiel? <verse eid="EZR 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 9:15"/>Yaye Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach Israel, in ja-ratiro! Owewa odiechiengni kaka joma otony. Eri wan e nyimi kaka joricho ma bura oloyo, kendo nikech richowago, onge ngʼato kuomwa manyalo chungo e nyimi.”<verse eid="EZR 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZR 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Ji ofulo richo mag-gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZR 10:1"/>Kane Ezra lemo kendo hulo richo, koywak kendo kongʼielore piny e nyim od Nyasaye, oganda maduongʼ mar jo-Israel; chwo, mon kod nyithindo nochokore kolwore. Gin bende ne giywak malit. <verse eid="EZR 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZR 10:2"/>Eka Shekania wuod Jehiel, achiel kuom nyikwa Elam, nowachone Ezra niya, “Ok wasebedo jo-ratiro ni Nyasachwa kuom kendo nyiri ma ok jo-Yahudi. To kata ka wasetimo kamano, to jo-Israel pod nigi geno. <verse eid="EZR 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZR 10:3"/>Koro we walos singo e nyim Nyasachwa mondo oriemb mon-gi kod nyithindgi duto, kaluwore gi ngʼado rieko mar Ruoth Nyasachwa kod jogo moluoro chike mag Nyasachwa. We time kaluwore gi Chik. <verse eid="EZR 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZR 10:4"/>Chungʼ malo; wachni ni e lweti. Wabiro konyi; omiyo jiwri kendo itime.”<verse eid="EZR 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZR 10:5"/>Omiyo Ezra noa malo mi oketo jonabi gi jo-Lawi ma jotelo kod jo-Israel duto e bwo kwongʼruok mondo otim gima ne osepar. Omiyo negitimo kwongʼruokno. <verse eid="EZR 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZR 10:6"/>Eka Ezra noa e nyim od Nyasaye mi odhi e agoch Jehohanan wuod Eliashib. E sa mane en kanyo, ne ok ochamo chiemo kendo ne ok omodho pi, nikech nodhi nyime kokuyo kuom bedo maonge ratiro mar joma noa e twech.<verse eid="EZR 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZR 10:7"/>Eka nogo milome e Juda kod Jerusalem ni jogo duto mane oa e twech mondo ochokre Jerusalem. <verse eid="EZR 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZR 10:8"/>Ngʼato angʼata ma ok onenore e thuolo mar ndalo adek biro lalo gige duto, kaluwore gi gima jotelo kod jodongo ongʼado, kendo enodire oko mar chokruok mar joma noa e twech.<verse eid="EZR 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZR 10:9"/>Kuom thuolo mar ndalo adek joma chwo moa Juda kod Benjamin duto nochokore Jerusalem. To e odiechiengʼ mar piero ariyo mar dwe mar ochiko, ji nobet e laru manie nyim od Nyasaye, ka gionge gi kwe nikech wachno kendo nikech koth ne goyogi. <verse eid="EZR 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZR 10:10"/>Eka Ezra ma jadolo noa malo kendo owachonegi niya, “Usebedo joma ok nikare; usekendo mond dhoudi mamoko, mumedo ketho mar jo-Israel. <verse eid="EZR 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZR 10:11"/>Koro miuru Jehova Nyasaye, ma Nyasach kwereu duongʼ, kendo utim dwarone. Thegreuru gi joma ni butu kod mondeu mag dhoudi mamoko.”<verse eid="EZR 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZR 10:12"/>Chokruok mar ogandani duto nodwoko gi dwol maduongʼ niya, “In kare! Nyaka watim kaka iwacho. <verse eid="EZR 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZR 10:13"/>To nitiere ji mangʼeny kae kendo en kinde koth, omiyo ok wanyal chungʼ oko. Ewi mano wachni ok nyal losi gi ndalo achiel kata ariyo, nikech wasetimo richo maduongʼ e gini. <verse eid="EZR 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZR 10:14"/>We jotendwa otime e lo chokruokni duto. Eka we ngʼato ka ngʼato mosekendo nyi joma ok jo-Yahudi obi e sa moketi, kaachiel gi jodongo kod jongʼad bura moa dala ka dala, nyaka mirima mager mar Nyasachwa kuom wachni ogol kuomwa.” <verse eid="EZR 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZR 10:15"/>Ji duto noyie timo kamano, makmana Jonathan wuod Asahel gi Jazeya wuod Tikva, koriwe lwedo gi Meshulam kod Shabethai ja-Lawi, ema notamore.<verse eid="EZR 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZR 10:16"/>Omiyo joma noa e twech notimo kaka nochan. Ezra jadolo noyiero chwo mane jotend dhoudi, achiel koa e migawo mar dhoot ka dhoot, kendo giduto noluongogi gi nying-gi. E odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mar apar negibedo piny mondo ginon wechegi, <verse eid="EZR 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZR 10:17"/>kendo kochopo odiechiengʼ mokwongo mar dwe mokwongo negitieko gi chwo mane okendo mon moa e dhoudi mamoko.<verse eid="EZR 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Joma ne nigi ketho mar nyombo e dhoudi mamoko</para>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZR 10:18"/>Kuom nyikwa jodolo, magi ema nokendo nyi joma ok jo-Yahudi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:18">Koa e nyikwa Jeshua wuod Jozadak, kod owetene:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:18">Maseya, Eliezer, Jarib gi Gedalia. <verse eid="EZR 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZR 10:19"/>Negitingʼo bedegi kaka singruok mar riembo mondegi, kendo kuom ketho mag-gi negichiwo im ngʼato ka ngʼato koa e kweth kaka misango mar pwodhruok e ketho.<verse eid="EZR 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZR 10:20"/>Koa e nyikwa Imer:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:20">Hanani gi Zebadia.<verse eid="EZR 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZR 10:21"/>Koa e nyikwa Harim:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:21">Maseya, Elija, Shemaya, Jehiel gi Uzia.<verse eid="EZR 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZR 10:22"/>Koa e nyikwa Pashur:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:22">Elioenai, Maseya, Ishmael, Nethanel, Jozabad gi Elasa.<verse eid="EZR 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZR 10:23"/>Kuom jo-Lawi ne gin:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:23">Jozabad, Shimei, Kelaya (tiende ni Kelita), Pethahia, Juda gi Eliezer.<verse eid="EZR 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZR 10:24"/>Koa kuom jower:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Eliashib.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:24">Koa kuom jorit dhorangach:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:24">Shalum, Telem gi Uri.<verse eid="EZR 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZR 10:25"/>To kuom jo-Israel mamoko:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EZR 10:25">Koa kuom nyikwa Parosh:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:25">Ramia, Izia, Malkija, Mijamin, Eliazar, Malkija gi Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZR 10:26"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Elam:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:26">Matania, Zekaria, Jehiel, Abdi, Jeremoth gi Elija.<verse eid="EZR 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZR 10:27"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Zatu:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:27">Elioenai, Eliashib, Matania, Jeremoth, Zabad gi Aziza.<verse eid="EZR 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZR 10:28"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Bebai:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:28">Jehohanan, Hanania, Zabai gi Athlai.<verse eid="EZR 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZR 10:29"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Bani:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:29">Meshulam, Maluk, Adaya, Jashub, Shil gi Jeremoth.<verse eid="EZR 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZR 10:30"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Pahath-Moab:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:30">Adna, Kelal, Benaya, Maseya, Matania, Bezalel, Binui gi Manase.<verse eid="EZR 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZR 10:31"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Harim:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:31">Eliezer, Ishija, Malkija, Shemaya, Shimeon, <verse eid="EZR 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZR 10:32"/>Benjamin, Maluk gi Shemaria.<verse eid="EZR 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZR 10:33"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Hashum:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:33">Matenai, Matata, Zabad, Elifelet, Jeremai, Manase gi Shimei.<verse eid="EZR 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZR 10:34"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Bani:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:34">Madai, Amram, Uel, <verse eid="EZR 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZR 10:35"/>Benaya, Bedeya, Keluhi, <verse eid="EZR 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZR 10:36"/>Vania, Meremoth, Eliashib, <verse eid="EZR 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZR 10:37"/>Matania, Matenai gi Jasu.<verse eid="EZR 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZR 10:38"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Binui:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:38">Shimei, <verse eid="EZR 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZR 10:39"/>Shelemia, Nathan, Adaya, <verse eid="EZR 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZR 10:40"/>Maknadebai, Shashai, Sharai, <verse eid="EZR 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZR 10:41"/>Azarel, Shelemia, Shemaria, <verse eid="EZR 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZR 10:42"/>Shalum, Amaria gi Josef.<verse eid="EZR 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZR 10:43"/>Koa kuom nyikwa Nebo:</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="EZR 10:43">Jeyel, Matithia, Zabad, Zebina, Jadai, Joel gi Benaya.<verse eid="EZR 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZR 10:44"/>Magi duto nokendo nyi joma ok jo-Yahudi, kendo moko kuomgi nonywolo nyithindo gi mon-gi.<verse eid="EZR 10:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EZR 10"/>
</usx>
